      <activity id="3edc8181-360a-5917-aa3f-1d7e7dd894c0" activityNameId="8662ebf1-be64-56e3-8c2f-a7f663b9356d" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Packing, fibre cement products</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Packing, fibre cement products
The production amount used for normalization is 20'000t/a. This module is assumed to be valid also for plants up to 100'000t/a. The lifespan of the infrastructure and the land occupation are assumed to be 50 years.;
UUID: e51a6231-80f0-3b3f-8d2e-1f776d69b762
Includes the process of packing, transportation, and loading of the bags on paletts. The machines, the waste treatment after use by the end-user of the fibre cement products and the transports of the packing materials are included.
Location: Data from a company producing lime products in Switzerland are adjusted
Technology: Assumed that packaging is the same as for lime products
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Assumption 
Extrapolations: See geography
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e51a6231-80f0-3b3f-8d2e-1f776d69b762.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
